{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10057","headline":"湘灵鼓瑟 · 王邕","name":"湘灵鼓瑟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝瑟和琴韵，灵妃应乐章。\n依稀闻促柱，髣髴梦新妆。\n波外声初发，风前曲正长。\n凄清和万籁，断续绕三湘。\n转觉云山迥，空怀杜若芳。\n诚能传此意，雅奏在宫商。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10057.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10057","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}